List every live lock, whoever holds it: name, holder, session, time left,
purpose and the card when one was named. Check it before touching a shared
resource.

Example:
  lorvik locks

Usage
  lorvik locks [flags]

Flags
      --cursor string   Continue from the next value printed by a previous page
  -h, --help            help for locks
  -L, --limit int       Maximum locks to print (default 50)

Global flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)
